	dc.b "%r3(Lost for words??/Got you there eh?/Say what you mean)",$00
sConvPatternThinkPositive:
	dc.b "(you think/) *= (is/are) (good/fun/mega/the best/ok/cool)",$00
	dc.b "Some say that %2 %3 %r3(sinful/wicked/overrated)",$00
